# sha256 of official Imagine modules. Exact module paths only.
# The manifest-sha256 line is the digest of this file with that hex zeroed.
# This self-hash is a drift check, not a trust anchor: anyone who can
# edit a pinned module can recompute it. Install trust is a folder
# owned by Administrators, the bot running as a standard account,
# and the updater running elevated. Signing the manifest with a key
# kept outside eche_source is the planned real anchor.
